---
Virtual Research Environment (VRE) operations

Usage: dsp vre [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  project        Manage DSP projects
  data-model     Manage data-models within a project
  resource-type  Manage resource-types within a data-model
  resource       List resource instances within a project
  vocabulary     Manage controlled vocabularies within a project (DSP-API "list")
  sparql         Raw SPARQL 1.1 query passthrough to the server's own triplestore
  help           Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -v, --verbose...             Increase log verbosity (-v=info, -vv=debug, -vvv=trace). RUST_LOG overrides
      --allow-insecure-server  Allow a non-local --server to use insecure http:// (see `dsp docs connecting`) [env: DSP_ALLOW_INSECURE_SERVER=]
  -h, --help                   Print help
